{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50READY, SET, RUMBLE! </h2>Join Sonic in the ultimate arcade royale where up to 32 players battle for glory in this free-to-play cross-platform game! It's not just a race, it's a Rumble!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.poster.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.webm?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.mp4?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1\ufe0fEPIC SONIC ACTION </h2>Dash, spin, and speed through iconic stages, while mastering skills in the chaos of Dr.Eggman\u2019s Toy World. From Green Hill Zone to Sky Sanctuary, experience the distinctive, high-speed Sonic gameplay in familiar and all-new levels! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/798623722c16d81f2f2fc77198b30464.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5MAYHEM IS BEST WITH FRIENDS </h2>Connect, compete, and play together! Squad up with friends and family in chaotic survival battles. Who will be the world\u2019s top Rumbler? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/850ac6379456e491a3a7102e6fe45d78.poster.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/850ac6379456e491a3a7102e6fe45d78.webm?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/850ac6379456e491a3a7102e6fe45d78.mp4?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc1TRIUMPH IN THE TOY WORLD </h2>Dr. Eggman has constructed a diabolical Toy World, complete with twisted obstacle courses and intense arenas. Master all of the exciting stages and game modes, from frantic races to epic survival battles. Emerge triumphant, claim your crown and win amazing rewards! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/e444b8801262c644f80ff2ec573a03f4.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udfa4A LEGENDARY LINEUP  </h2>Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles, Amy, Shadow, Dr. Eggman, and other Sonic-series favorites! <br>Customize your characters to your heart\u2019s content with a variety of skins, animations, emotes, effects, and more! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.poster.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.webm?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/19b18ca52439c48412dc1a0e6b9f577b.mp4?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf1RUMBLE AT HOME OR ON THE GO</h2> Sonic Rumble is available on both PC and mobile, offering a seamless and speedy experience whenever and wherever! Dash into the world of Sonic and experience the thrill and mayhem on your preferred platform.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.poster.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.webm?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/f8d84c7cd9f4102b26bf871818765243.mp4?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5A STANDOUT SONIC SOUNDTRACK </h2>Sonic Rumble features fast-paced tunes for those with a need for speed. Keep an ear out for iconic bangers from the Sonic series and groove along to some familiar anthems! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/a64d454497d8aeb7afba7eb4ae43eeb0.poster.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/a64d454497d8aeb7afba7eb4ae43eeb0.webm?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/a64d454497d8aeb7afba7eb4ae43eeb0.mp4?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2951690/06f21a9b13260ef23453dacafddf9ca4fa4d17fc.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Shopper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2951690/42e5c0d468564c074d2150df927d618da2cca4f2.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Emblem Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2951690/06f21a9b13260ef23453dacafddf9ca4fa4d17fc.jpg"},{"name":"Excellent Emblem Hunter","path":"https://cdn.a