":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50READY, SET, RUMBLE! </h2>Join Sonic in the ultimate arcade royale where up to 32 players battle for glory in this free-to-play cross-platform game! It's not just a race, it's a Rumble!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.poster.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.webm?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/82125e435dd3976cd85b5dce4bed7d30.mp4?t=1763091476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1\ufe0fEPIC SONIC ACTION </h2>Dash, spin, and speed through iconic stages, while mastering skills in the chaos of Dr.Eggman\u2019s Toy World. From Green Hill Zone to Sky Sanctuary, experience the distinctive, high-speed Sonic gameplay in familiar and all-new levels! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/798623722c16d81f2f2fc77198b30464.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5MAYHEM IS BEST WITH FRIENDS </h2>Connect, compete, and play together! Squad up with friends and family in chaotic survival battles. Who will be the world\u2019s top Rumbler? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2951690/extras/850ac6379456e491a3a7102e6fe45d78.poster.avif?t=1763091476\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st